{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35810","headline":"雪十二韵 · 李咸用","name":"雪十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六出凝阴气，同云指上天。\n结时风乍急，集处霰长先。\n草穗翘祥燕，陂桩吐白莲。\n犬狂南陌上，竹醉小池前。\n樵径花黏履，渔舟玉帖舷。\n阵经阳谷薄，势想朔方偏。\n楼面光摇锡，篱头晓列钱。\n石苔青鹿卧，殿网素蛾穿。\n嘶马应思塞，蹲乌似爲燕。\n童痴爲兽揑，僧爱用茶煎。\n念物希周穆，含毫愧惠连。\n吟阑余兴逸，还忆剡溪船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}